  "settings.deepSeekSearch": ["DeepSeek 联网搜索", "DeepSeek web search", "Pesquisa na web do DeepSeek"],
  "settings.deepSeekHelp": ["通过 DeepSeek 独立 Search / Fetch API 提供搜索与网页提取，使用当前 Agent 选择的模型生成查询和整理结果。", "Use the separate DeepSeek Search / Fetch API for search and page extraction. The current Agent’s model generates queries and organizes results.", "Use a API separada DeepSeek Search / Fetch para busca e extração de páginas. O modelo atual do Agent gera consultas e organiza os resultados."],
  "settings.deepSeekNetworkHelp": ["搜索请求由 ARTEX 服务端发往 DeepSeek，可使用上方独立出口代理。API Key 只保存于服务端设置，不会回显。", "ARTEX sends requests to DeepSeek from the server, using the separate outbound proxy above if configured. API keys are stored on the server and never shown.", "O ARTEX envia solicitações ao DeepSeek a partir do servidor, usando o proxy de saída separado acima, se configurado. As chaves de API são armazenadas no servidor e nunca são exibidas."],
  "settings.keyConfiguredPlaceholder": ["已配置（留空则不变）", "Configured (leave blank to keep)", "Configurado (deixe em branco para manter)"],
